      "side": 1,
      "message": "Whats an example of payload that pvmfw should support in Android 15+?\n\n`instance-id` is the unique Id of the VM introduced in Android 15 and is required irrespective of `defer-rbp`.\n\n1. It contributes to the differentiation of secrets in Nonprotected VM[a]. \n2. (Instance-hash derived from instance-id) is needed for RKPVM (\u0026 apparently Trusty VM too)[b]\n\n[a] https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Virtualization/guest/microdroid_manager/src/dice.rs;l\u003d70?q\u003dget_instance_id\u0026ss\u003dh%2Fgoogleplex-android%2Fplatform%2Fsuperproject%2Fmain%2F%2B%2Frefs%2Fheads%2Fmain:packages%2Fmodules%2FVirtualization%2Fguest%2Fmicrodroid_manager%2F\n\n[b] https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Virtualization/guest/pvmfw/src/main.rs;l\u003d130-161?q\u003dinstance-id%20file:pvmfw\u0026ss\u003dh%2Fgoogleplex-android%2Fplatform%2Fsuperproject%2Fmain%2F%2B%2Frefs%2Fheads%2Fmain:packages%2Fmodules%2FVirtualization%2F",
