      "side": 1,
      "message": "`instance-id` is the identity of the VM \u0026 is important. But understandably, there can be buggy environments where /avf/untrusted/ is not present \u0026 if you do not wish for pvmfw to not panic in those case - SGTM. (Do we have examples of such environment?)\n\nOffline I suggested getting `fn instance_id(fdt: \u0026Fdt)` to return all 0s in those cases, but rethinking *it might* be an idea to use random bytes to differentiate instance.img of Vms in such buggy environment.\n\nBut do we want to maintain those?",
